    "nonPromotionRules": [
      "A green CI run is evidence about that run; it is not universal certification.",
      "A finite mechanical test is not a mathematical proof about the general model.",
      "A conformance obligation is not discharged by restating the specification.",
      "A theorem about an abstract model does not establish that a concrete implementation conforms.",
      "An audit or verification-status record cannot waive a normative requirement or create authority."
